        "LocalizationKey": "HarshWilds_Dancing_StatDescription",
        "DefaultText": "A dance you cannot stop, begun in a fairy ring at night. It wears off by itself over a few hours; a cleansing smudge burned at a lit fire breaks it at once."
    },
